{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:03.24]Ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy (Ayy, ayy, ayy)\n[00:07.78]Ayy, ayy (Ayy), rollin' off a Xan, ayy (Rollin', woah, woah)\n[00:11.06]Paranoia, I can't stand, ayy-ayy\n[00:12.72]Sauce, yeah, yeah, sauce, yeah\n[00:17.50]Ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy, (Dez Wright) woah, woah\n[Verse]\n[00:27.50]Okay, okay, okay, okay, I done came through with the 'K\n[00:31.26]I'm the man, with a dream, like I'm Martin Luther King\n[00:34.68]Where the lean? Pour it up, high fashion, tore it up\n[00:38.22]And your girl? On her knees, yeah, she gon' swallow up\n[00:41.78]I been balling like I'm John Wall, Wizards on these niggas\n[00:45.12]Wrist cold, mouth cold, like a blizzard on these niggas\n[00:48.70]God Damn, God Damn, I'ma sauce on a bitch\n[00:52.20]Gold grills, rose gold, I'ma floss on a bitch\n[00:55.56]Okay I'm known for taking bitches on the daily, ayy, ayy\n[00:59.10]I ball like rockets, this that new Tracy McGrady, ayy\n[01:02.52]You got a problem, that's okay, I come through spraying, ayy\n[01:06.04]I got that Jackie Chan kush that lil' Asian, ayy, okay\n[01:09.92]I got a Mexican bitch and an Asian bae\n[01:13.06]And I've been fucking all these bitches by the fucking bay\n[01:16.54]I got your girl doing acid, she snort fucking yay'\n[01:20.06]And if she ain't paying for coke, out my fucking way, the fuck away, ayy\n[01:25.30]I say I'm balling like a fadeaway\n[01:28.84]Your girl gon' fuck, another day\n[01:31.40]I popped a Xan, what can I fucking say?\n[01:35.16]On these beats, going dumb, Dr. Dre, ayy\n[01:39.06]Damn, God damn, God damn, God damn\n[01:41.72]I am who I am, yeah, I am who I am\n[01:45.14]I'm in the kitchen whipping eggs, young Sam-I-Am\n[01:48.10]I'm dunking on these bitches heads, no NBA Jam, God Damn\n[01:53.52]Saucing up, boy I swear I'm the man, what the fuck\n[01:58.58]I'm high as hell, I felt like this way for months (Yeah)\n[02:01.62]I guess that's what happens when you smoke 40 blunts (Yeah)\n[02:05.56]I'm super fly, super high, she c